    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d88">

                <pb facs="0157" n="135" sameAs="frus:frus1950v03/pg135"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.5/7–2050: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Embassy in France
                    </hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d88-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1950-07-21T20:00:00-04:00">July 21, 1950—8 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>399. Embtel 385, July 20. While we fully
                    recognize importance of tripartite consultation on most matters and wish to
                    encourage it we wish definitely to play down tripartite activity in NAT framework. We have consistently made clear to
                    the Fr our strong objection to any “political standing group” and we would
                    certainly not wish any such body established in Wash since this wld completely
                    undermine Deputies, whom we regard as essential spark plug agency of whole
                        NATO machinery. Naturally US–UK–Fr Deputies
                    will have much to discuss and will work closely together but this shld be on
                    strictly informal basis. Less said about it the better.</p>
                <p>Pls convey foregoing to Alphand.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d88-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d88-f1-content">
